      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "① DB 终态提交（独立 5 秒预算）\n锁 run 行，校验 run_id + resume_time\n活动状态 → failed，写 finished_at / error / error_code\n已终态 → 保留原状态，changed=False\n返回本次事务的快照及 changed",
      "originalText": "① DB 终态提交（独立 5 秒预算）\n锁 run 行，校验 run_id + resume_time\n活动状态 → failed，写 finished_at / error / error_code\n已终态 → 保留原状态，changed=False\n返回本次事务的快照及 changed",
      "fontSize": 23,
      "fontFamily": 2,
      "textAlign": "center",
      "verticalAlign": "middle",
      "containerId": "f-db",
      "autoResize": true,
